  promptTilt: 0.5
  focusHeight: 0.75
  dialogueText: 'There''s only two types of folks on these moons - the one with the bigger shootin'' iron, and the one who''s dead. I''d ask you what typa Cowpoke you are, but I reckon we both know the answer. '
