  promptTilt: 0.5
  focusHeight: 0.75
  dialogueText: 'Howdy partner! My apologies if the locals come off a little frosty - I''d reckon they ain''t used to seein'' a cyclops fall out the sky! Livin down in the caves leaves you a little less green in the gills. '
